hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1242","Yunus bin Abdul-Ala told us, Ibn Wahb told us, that Malik told him, on the authority of Ibn Shihab, H, and Abdullah bin Hashim told us Abdul Rahman bin Mahdi told us, on the authority of Malik, on the authority of Al-Zuhri, on the authority of Al-Sa’ib bin Yazid, on the authority of Al-Muttalib bin Abi Wada’ah, on the authority of Hafsa said: I have never seen the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, praying his Subha sitting, even if it was a year before his death, and it was He prays his rosary sitting, then he recites the surah and recites it until it is longer than a longer one.” Ibn Hashim did not say: in his rosary"
